---
description: Flutter Clean Architecture + MVVM rules for apps/mobile
globs: apps/mobile/**/*.dart
alwaysApply: false
---

Feature folders: `lib/features/{name}/{data,domain,presentation}`. Domain has no Flutter imports. Views do not call repositories. ViewModels do not import `dart:ui` or `material.dart`. Use get_it + injectable, dartz Either. No `print()`. No hardcoded strings or colors.
